        .state-indicator.running
        | Running

    tr
      th ID
      td colspan='3'
        | 9ed35e220ebabd573b9f130a738e083cc73b4b8e3daa88c3923ec4ab3294e5b7

    tr
      th Short Name
      td colspan='3'
        | web-app

    tr
